{"text":"She issued a scathing critique on the Neo-Soviet government, condemning their weakness in losing control over their own elite Tactical Doll squad known as Task Force DEFY.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her criticism directly targeted the still-missing member of the squad, known by the codename \"AK-12\". She claimed that the Neo-Soviet regime had utilized Relic technology in the Doll's development process, which directly resulted in her going rogue.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"TV Program Host","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Styx further argued that humanity has strayed too far from nature, and that continued obsession with this path of defiance will only bring about further retribution from nature itself.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"According to footage sent in by our on-site correspondents, Styx's speech was met with widespread approval from the gathered onlookers, with some citizens even taking to the streets to publicly echo her statements.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"786","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"TV Program Host","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As of this broadcast, the Neo-Soviet government has yet to issue any official response.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_23SF_Battle_2","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"72","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...University of Mainz Online Forum."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Speculation on the Neo-Soviet Union's Use of Relic Technology.\"","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"What Impact Might Relic Energy Have on Daily Life?\"","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Exploring the Possible Changes in Dolls After Exposure to Relic Energy\"","style":{"color":"#FFFF00"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Styx's speech is like a massive stone thrown onto a frozen lake—hairline cracks immediately begin to spiderweb outward."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"This is supposed to be a forum for academic discussion and campus life. What are all these ridiculous posts doing here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_21Winter_Click_Keyboard","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Constanze logs into her admin account and starts cleaning up the plague-like flood of posts."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 3289","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Guys, I think Styx is absolutely right!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dolls were functioning just fine before, why would they suddenly go rogue and start a terrorist attack? It's clearly because one of them got infected with Relic energy!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then it spread like a virus to the others! That's why we're in this mess!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 0983","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Easy to spread rumors, hard to debunk them. Have you even read Professor Persica's article debunking all this?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Dr. Shaw, the designer of the DEFY Dolls, published her research long ago. All her papers are public!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's a staunch anti-Relic scientist—why would she ever infuse her life's work with the very thing she opposes?!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 3768","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yeah, not to mention Dr. Shaw's elder sister was part of Pandora, right? No way she'd secretly use Relic tech...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_21Winter_Click_Keyboard","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Constanze selects this batch of overly active users and mutes them temporarily."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 5499","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't care what any of you say! I'm standing with Fraulein Styx no matter what!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's just so gorgeous—and that body, wow! If only she could be my wife!!!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_2023Slow_Keyboard_Error","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Resisting the urge to roll her eyes, Constanze promptly bans this user."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 2309","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Get lost, perv. This is an academic forum—go be horny somewhere else!","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As for Styx's accusations about the DEFY Doll \"AK-12\" being a product of Relic tech—there's no solid evidence so far. I lean toward this being just her personal speculation.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"On the other hand, I find Professor Persica's published rebuttal and technical proofs credible.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Anyone who's ever written a thesis knows how painful the process is—you can't fake your intent or your biases in that process.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And I could totally see Dr. Shaw's hatred for the Relics bleeding through in her work.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Anonymous User 9074","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If it really is all nonsense, then why hasn't the Neo-Soviet government said a word?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Shouldn't they be jumping in immediately to denounce this defamation?","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe there really is something they can't admit...","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Anonymous User 5646","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hard to say. Even if they didn't use Relic tech, the Neo-Soviets probably resorted to some other shady methods.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, why were their Dolls the first to go rogue? Look at us—our Dolls are still behaving just fine.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_21Winter_Click_Keyboard","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"735","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The endless flood of discussions drowns out every single sub-forum. Constanze scrolls through the threads with a deepening frown."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She's given up on deleting posts and banning users—now she's just concerned about the state of academic literacy among her peers."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ugh. Hopefully none of my underclassmen are involved in this mess. And if they are, I pray to God they've already finished their thesis proposals..."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Otherwise, I'm gonna be stuck cleaning up after them all weekend again!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_tele_disconnect","raw":"SE1"},{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shutting down the campus forum with a groan, Constanze stands and stretches."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Time to tidy up the lab."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"All this equipment lying around, and the thick layer of dust... If Nele sees this, she's gonna have a meltdown."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"AVG_Wheelchair","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"She picks up a brush, ready to start cleaning. That's when she notices Nele standing silently in the doorway."}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Her hair and coat are soaking wet, as if she has walked here through the rain."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nele? When did you get here? Why are you just standing there like that?"}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You're soaked... Let me grab you a towel!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Nele","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nele","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nele takes the towel absentmindedly, her eyes fixed on Constanze as though she's made some kind of decision."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Nele","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Nele","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Connie, there's something I have to confess to you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Constanze","expression":1,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Constanze","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Nele","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Nele","narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Nele","expression":5,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"cgDelay","value":"0.5","raw":"CGDelay"}],"speaker":"Nele","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The truth... about the experiment..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"9","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blacksc